5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about the cold creeping in before we agree on a fair split.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am tired of money making us avoid each other in the hallway.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know if the current split is actually fair for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I need to see the real numbers before I commit to another winter.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried about who has to do the math every month.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, do you think the current method is too harsh in winter?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, I agree, fairness is key, but so is keeping the peace.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, I hope we can find a way that feels right for all of us.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, yes, the winter bills are what really hurt my budget.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I am looking into how much time the current system takes.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the sunlight and heating needs of each room.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will look at the payment log to see the history of disputes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the last twelve utility statements to see the variation.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the electrician's quote to see the cost of meters.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the monthly settle observed at another house.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Also, I will check the winter habits at a house paying ahead.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,And I will look at the kitchen notice about the cooler.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also check the plug-in monitor readings room by room.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
