35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The north rooms need heat from November, but the south ones stay warm.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The payment log shows three late settlements, each after a query about the amount.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The bills swing wildly, from 9,000 in August to 29,400 in February.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room for meters, plus annual checks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The other house spent forty minutes just logging readings and splitting the kitchen bill.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, that swing is huge. It makes the flat share feel unstable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, 34,000 yen is a lot of upfront cost for just one room.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, yes, and the plug-in monitor showed one room uses four times more.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, forty minutes a month is a lot of time for someone to spend.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, the late payments show that the current system causes friction.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,I remember a house that paid a fixed seasonal rate; nobody worried about switches.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,The cooler notice stayed up all summer because people were afraid to argue.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,The trial run of the template meant keying in every invoice by hand.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"The reconciliation template was tedious, but it showed exactly who owed what.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"When the last rooms filled, it took three weeks to agree on the split.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@May, the fixed rate might be simpler, but is it fair for the north rooms?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I worry that a fixed rate hides the real cost of heating.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Daisuke, three weeks is too long to be in limbo.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Minato, the metering is expensive, but it is the most accurate.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, accuracy is good, but the time cost is high for the person managing it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
